cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use crypto-service-sdk-java in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "crypto-service-sdk-java: a typed Java client for the Crypto Service REST API"
abstract: >-
  A thin, typed Java client for the Crypto Service REST API
  (crypto-server): hashing, MACs, key derivation, AEAD, server-held
  Ed25519 and post-quantum keys, HPKE and KMS, all performed by the
  server. It is proven against the server by the Crypto Service
  conformance kit.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
version: "0.0.41"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/crypto-service-sdk-java"
url: "https://crypto-service.co"
keywords:
  - cryptography
  - post-quantum
  - ML-KEM
  - ML-DSA
  - Java
  - SDK
